Begin Login Using Default Username
	Navigate "?f=logout"
	Type {selenium_username} into the login_user input
	Type {selenium_password} into the login_passwd input
	Click the "Log In" button
	Screenshot okralogin
Begin Sidemenu Usage
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the E-Chart sidemenu entry
	Screenshot echart
Begin Pin Sidemenu
	Pin the sidemenu
	Screenshot pinned
Begin Charttabs
	Click the "Injection Program" charttab tab
	Screenshot injectionprogram
